# Scratch icon copies in the repo root.
#
# The icons that actually ship live in web/public/ and are tracked there:
# web/public/icon-reloaded.png is the favicon, web/public/icon-{192,512,
# maskable-512}.png back the manifest and apple-touch-icon. These root copies
# are scratch working files, and committing them would create a second,
# silently-stale source of truth for the same artwork.
/icon.png
/icon_reloaded.png
